# unknown-method.tflw — CHECK-ONLY FIXTURE (M49, PLAN_WEBV2_M45.md): an unrecognised HTTP method
# after `api` — demonstrates `tflw check`'s teaching diagnostic (TF012: parser, an unknown HTTP
# method, "did you mean `PATCH`?").
#
